# Citation metadata for the book. GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository",
# and Zenodo will read it when the first DOI is minted (plans/versioning_and_feedback.md).
# Author metadata lives here and nowhere else.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this book, please cite it using the metadata below. Give the
  version you read; it is printed in the footer of every page.
